*  zb_arena_collection_grow - forces ARBNO v2 COLLECTION past its initial
*  capacity of 4 elements (needs 10 iterations: growth sequence 4->8->16),
*  to exercise rt_zcol_push's grow-and-copy path under ZC_COL_ARENA, not
*  just the never-grows path the existing corpus happens to hit.  Uses a
*  plain ALT (deterministic branches) as the rightmost leaf, sufficient to
*  make sno_pat_deterministic refuse v1 and route to v2, without needing
*  FENCE (unsupported in this build's lowered subset, unrelated gap).
        s = 'abcdefghij'
        s POS(0) ARBNO(LEN(1) | LEN(1)) RPOS(0)    :S(YES)F(NO)
YES     OUTPUT = 'grow ok'                          :(END)
NO      OUTPUT = 'fail'
END
